  "statuteText": "169-E:2-a Hotline for Missing Children; Rulemaking. –\n\nThere is hereby established a toll-free statewide hotline for the purpose of reporting information on missing children. This hotline shall have its terminus at the central communication section of the New Hampshire division of state police. The director of the division of state police shall adopt rules under RSA 541-A relative to its administration and operation."
